## Personal Use

Use of the software by an individual for that individual's own purposes is use
for a permitted purpose, whether or not those purposes are commercial and
whether or not the individual has a company. This covers personal use, study,
and an individual's own professional work, including work performed for or
delivered to a client of any size.

## Sharing Between Individuals

An individual may give a copy of the software to another individual, provided a
copy of these terms goes with it.

This permission does not extend to distribution by an organization or by anyone
acting on an organization's behalf. Deploying the software to an organization's
members, including copying it into shared or managed systems, bundling it into
a product or service, and offering it for sale or other consideration all
